ommon is &quot;investment grade&quot; and a scammers &quot;100% authentic&quot; card is anything but. Read between the lines, check the centering, watch the fake risk, and find the hidden gems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seven marketplaces unlock as your reputation grows from the everyday FeeBay feed to the goblin run auction floor and the curated, wildly overpriced VaultDealer.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Open packs, find hidden gems and get lucky.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547880/extras/bb844cba46e21d4fa04f34599f2792c5.poster.avif?t=1782920852\" width=1170 height=752 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547880/extras/bb844cba46e21d4fa04f34599f2792c5.webm?t=1782920852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547880/extras/bb844cba46e21d4fa04f34599f2792c5.mp4?t=1782920852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grade your grails.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think a card will gem? Ship it to one of three grading houses, speedy ZAG, prestigious PZA, or gloriously unpredictable Bucket Grading. Each with its own fees, turnaround, and chaos factor. Then reveal the slab yourself, and pray to the grading Gods for some Gem Mint 10s!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547880/extras/09bf0379e5a1ec9a6f709e80861c8ed9.poster.avif?t=1782920852\" width=1170 height=752 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547880/extras/09bf0379e5a1ec9a6f709e80861c8ed9.webm?t=1782920852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547880/extras/09bf0379e5a1ec9a6f709e80861c8ed9.mp4?t=1782920852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Bucket</strong> sometimes hands out a very special grade.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547880/extras/cd902569c815f15231b0d59c455ead7a.avif?t=1782920852\" width=338 height=592 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect all 1339* cards.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feebay</strong> comes loaded with it's own custom TCG, an ever-expanding TCG with around 1339 unique cards. Track every set in the Collection Codex, lock your favorites away in an animated Showcase, and chase the cards that look as good as they're worth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547880/extras/edd1f7a95f90c3573aaa54c109b37265.poster.avif?t=1782920852\" width=1128 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547880/extras/edd1f7a95f90c3573aaa54c109b37265.webm?t=1782920852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547880/extras/edd1f7a95f90c3573aaa54c109b37265.mp4?t=1782920852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Run your own storefront.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >List your cards at your own prices and watch buyers nibble. Some pay instantly, some make you wait, and some bail entirely. Funds pool in your storefront wallet until you withdraw them - minus FeeBay's completely reasonable 14% cut. I heard there's some upgrades to help improve this workflow...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547880/extras/dedeac89836b782d703042369ea301d5.avif?t=1782920852\" width=1132 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547880/extras/4f84d2a4347d331b48eb58af6f434915.poster.avif?t=1782920852\" width=1170 height=752 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547880/extras/4f84d2a4347d331b48eb58af6f434915.webm?t=1782920852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547880/extras/4f84d2a4347d331b48eb58af6f434915.mp4?t=1782920852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Hopefully everyone pays....</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547880/extras/1be123e7f745d0120ae74328d743a631.poster.avif?t=1782920852\" width=1142 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547880/extras/1be123e7f745d0120ae74328d743a631.webm?t=1782920852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547880/extras/1be123e7f745d0120ae74328d743a631.mp4?t=1782920852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547880/extras/9ea24591bb4b892fd55b9a8203ddf4e6.avif?t=1782920852\" width=1094 height=108 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ride the market.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prices breathe. Trend events send cards soaring and crash reprinted sets overnight, conventions pump entire sets, and a &quot;First Edition Frenzy&quot; that can turn a dusty binder into rent money. Time your buys, hold through the dips, and try not to panic-sell.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Modding</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feebay</strong> has a full suite for the <strong>modding community</strong> to dive into. Explore steams workshop and download community created mods! Mods expand or replace the base game in many different ways including adding several new cards and sets, modify game settings, change grading company names, new and better game balancing as well as full on funny meme mods!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547880/extras/294a287af9046e6594da78e6b39f5df2.avif?t=1782920852\" width=1398 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>- </i>A living parody marketplace</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>- </i>1339 collectible cards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- An active modding community with updated mods</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>- </i>Three grading companies </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>- </i>Mystery lots, binders, packs, and abandoned storage units to crack open</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>- </i>A goblin-run auction house with bidding and auto-snipe</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>- </i>Build and price your own storefront</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>- </i>A live market of trends, events, and conventions that move real prices</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>- </i>Business levels, upgrades, achievements, automation and employees</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>- </i>Card centering, condition grades, and fakes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AI Disclosure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recently I started seeing some reviews point out no AI disclosure. AI assisted coding is the only AI usage here on Feebay, its becoming an industry standard and a great tool to speed up development process. I may use AI for translations the future. <strong>Steam does not require an AI disclosure for coding related usage</strong> however it feels necessary given the <i><strong>miss-information</strong></i> out there. No AI is used for user consumed content such and art and images. <i>The <strong>Feebay</strong> creature art comes from an artist named AaronSprites. Mods may contain AI generated images and are not a reflection of Feebay in anyway, community created mods assume their own responsibilities.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Buy the dip. Rip some packs. Read the description. Probably do not trust @definitely_real_cards.</i></p>", "short_description": "Flip fake trading cards for real profit in FeeBay Simulator, a comedic marketplace tycoon game. Snipe underpriced cards from clueless and scammy sellers, grade your best pulls, open mystery lots, rip packs and run your own storefront to build a reselling empire.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547880/89bc6ca2e76ea9954d8ccd0ea5f2cacb4261e0f6/header.jpg?t=1782920852", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547880/3d54f6751f3a03f4e927cd438cc8cbac1b1ef697/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782920852", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547880/3d54f6751f3a03f4e927cd438cc8cbac1b1ef697/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782920852", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 (SP1+) or higher<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 500 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> N/A<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 250 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Requires a 64-bit process